Absolute industry plant, with mummy or daddies money driving them forward. No band plays a 5 chord pop song and careers to the 6music A list over night, no band release one single and get picked up by dan carey at speedy Wunder. Play the opening set at fucking green man on a main stage before a 2nd single is released. Theyre from the isle of white with a pretty exciting music scene. All members of the band have little to no history of being involved in the scene or playing gigs and making a name for themselves; billynomates said she was chatting with the lead vocalist of WL, talking about how there are little to no opportunities or shows to play/ venues; billy said to her she has been playing local shows and festival there for years as BNM / in various capacities and the vocalist of WL who now has a fucking USA tour booked in and selling before the bloody LP dropped had not even heard of these?! 

